WEBVTT

01:43.800 --> 01:44.640
Xing Wu...

01:49.440 --> 01:50.720
Are you sure you're OK?

01:57.280 --> 01:57.880
Seriously,

01:58.440 --> 01:59.520
I'm fine.

02:00.240 --> 02:02.080
I'll just put some ice pops

02:02.080 --> 02:03.040
on it.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.560
It'll soothe the burn.

02:05.520 --> 02:06.440
Plus, I can eat them after.

02:21.079 --> 02:22.440
I'll go check on them

02:22.880 --> 02:24.200
and see what they need.

02:30.200 --> 02:30.720
Sleep tight.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.079
Grandma,

02:57.520 --> 02:59.040
the bed is ready.

02:59.440 --> 03:01.000
I plugged in

03:01.360 --> 03:02.840
an electric blanket.

03:02.920 --> 03:04.680
The heat is on, too.

03:05.200 --> 03:06.280
Adjust the temp

03:06.520 --> 03:08.120
if you need.

03:08.360 --> 03:09.160
Remote is

03:09.200 --> 03:10.680
on the nightstand.

03:12.400 --> 03:14.120
Thank you.

03:14.240 --> 03:14.720
Thank you.

03:14.720 --> 03:15.320
No problem.

03:15.320 --> 03:16.680
Thank you...

03:19.280 --> 03:19.840
Grandma,

03:20.120 --> 03:22.360
I got you slippers

03:22.360 --> 03:23.120
and PJs.

03:23.960 --> 03:24.840
Never been

03:24.920 --> 03:25.800
worn.

03:26.160 --> 03:27.240
My size will

03:27.320 --> 03:28.160
fit you perfectly.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.160
Let me slip them on for you.

03:30.079 --> 03:31.000
Please, you've done enough.

03:31.840 --> 03:32.160
It's OK.

03:32.160 --> 03:33.400
Lanfang will

03:33.520 --> 03:34.400
take care of it.

03:36.200 --> 03:36.720
Yufen,

03:39.160 --> 03:39.720
I've got this.

03:40.760 --> 03:41.360
Thanks.

03:42.560 --> 03:43.240
OK,

03:43.360 --> 03:44.000
Lanfang, um...

03:44.040 --> 03:45.079
go ahead.

03:45.320 --> 03:46.160
I'll go get

03:46.160 --> 03:47.000
toiletries.

03:47.920 --> 03:49.000
I'll prep

03:49.240 --> 03:50.160
some hot water.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.440
Hold on to me.

04:09.560 --> 04:10.000
There.

04:17.000 --> 04:17.680
Cold?

04:18.440 --> 04:19.040
I'm good.

04:25.400 --> 04:25.880
Yeah...

04:51.920 --> 04:52.880
Lanfang...

04:53.640 --> 04:56.200
I didn't mean to...

04:57.440 --> 04:58.440
Mom, stop.

04:59.280 --> 05:01.120
It's fine. It happens.

05:03.080 --> 05:05.640
I lost all feeling in my legs.

05:06.440 --> 05:07.600
Next thing I knew,

05:08.120 --> 05:09.240
it just...

05:15.640 --> 05:16.640
You are unbelievable!

05:17.400 --> 05:19.000
You play the sweet, happy grandma,

05:19.800 --> 05:21.200
but you're just like Wu,

05:22.040 --> 05:23.000
stubborn as hell!

05:23.520 --> 05:24.720
You just bottle it up

05:25.040 --> 05:26.200
and say

05:26.360 --> 05:27.880
nothing.

05:28.440 --> 05:28.880
I...

05:28.920 --> 05:29.880
Why do you all have to be

05:29.880 --> 05:31.120
so damn tough?

05:32.200 --> 05:33.520
Why can't you just lean on me?

05:33.840 --> 05:34.600
If you're hungry, eat.

05:35.080 --> 05:35.760
If you're tired, sleep.

05:37.200 --> 05:38.120
And if

05:39.720 --> 05:40.880
you're in trouble,

05:41.159 --> 05:41.800
scream for help!

05:44.159 --> 05:45.159
OK, OK...

05:57.560 --> 05:58.280
Sweetie,

05:58.600 --> 05:59.040
please,

05:59.640 --> 06:00.760
don't be mad.

06:00.920 --> 06:01.720
Calm down.

06:06.800 --> 06:07.960
I'm not mad at you!

06:08.880 --> 06:10.400
I'm just so damn scared for you!

06:12.280 --> 06:13.760
I care about you.

06:15.240 --> 06:17.360
You're gonna eat yourself alive

06:18.560 --> 06:19.760
if you don't let it out!

06:21.480 --> 06:22.480
I know...

06:28.040 --> 06:29.040
but the house

06:30.280 --> 06:31.720
is gone.

06:31.960 --> 06:34.360
What do we do now?

06:34.560 --> 06:35.760
To hell with the house!

06:37.240 --> 06:38.640
I'm not going anywhere...

06:40.720 --> 06:42.240
and I'm sure as hell not abandoning you!

06:43.200 --> 06:44.120
I know...

06:45.920 --> 06:46.880
You and Wu...

06:46.880 --> 06:49.400
are my whole world.

06:50.320 --> 06:51.680
I'm never leaving you, Mom.

06:53.960 --> 06:55.640
My son is a total screw-up.

06:56.560 --> 06:57.760
Thank God I have you.

06:59.000 --> 07:01.400
You're like my own daughter.

07:02.600 --> 07:04.320
I'm so blessed to have you.

07:05.080 --> 07:07.040
I wouldn't have made it this far

07:07.400 --> 07:08.080
without

07:08.440 --> 07:10.760
you two.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.080
Hey,

07:20.520 --> 07:21.880
stop crying.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.720
We're gonna

07:28.120 --> 07:29.520
get through this.

07:29.960 --> 07:31.360
I promise.

07:33.880 --> 07:34.560
Lanfang...

07:35.040 --> 07:36.080
Look.

07:38.760 --> 07:40.080
I kept this safe

07:40.320 --> 07:42.320
from

07:42.520 --> 07:43.520
the fire...

07:45.000 --> 07:45.640
I'm not just

07:45.680 --> 07:47.159
a useless old woman.

07:47.159 --> 07:47.680
There's

07:48.200 --> 07:50.120
a good chunk of cash here.

07:56.440 --> 07:57.000
Oh, Mom...

08:49.640 --> 08:50.200
Wu?

08:50.360 --> 08:51.320
[Hey, Mom.]

08:52.200 --> 08:53.080
[How's everything?]

08:53.360 --> 08:54.320
Good.

08:54.680 --> 08:55.640
Grandma just fell asleep.

08:56.200 --> 08:56.800
Good.

09:00.520 --> 09:01.000
What about you?

09:02.560 --> 09:03.240
You OK?

09:04.080 --> 09:05.520
I'm superb.

09:06.280 --> 09:07.640
You know me.

09:08.400 --> 09:09.840
I'm a survivor.

09:11.720 --> 09:12.960
I tried to grab some supplies

09:12.960 --> 09:13.800
for you,

09:14.240 --> 09:15.600
but everything's shut down for the night.

09:15.920 --> 09:16.800
[It's OK, sweetie.]

09:17.240 --> 09:18.360
Shanxi brought us

09:18.360 --> 09:19.040
everything

09:19.040 --> 09:20.400
we need.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.320
Alright.

09:25.680 --> 09:26.800
I'll come by tomorrow.

09:27.520 --> 09:27.920
Sounds good.

09:28.280 --> 09:29.240
See you tomorrow.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.880
Get some rest.

09:31.840 --> 09:32.400
You too, Mom.

10:05.000 --> 10:05.520
Hey,

10:06.280 --> 10:07.040
you've had a rough night.

10:08.120 --> 10:09.320
I made some dumplings.

10:09.680 --> 10:10.320
Eat up.

10:10.640 --> 10:11.520
Zero appetite.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.040
Just a little bit.

10:13.440 --> 10:14.720
I really can't...

10:16.960 --> 10:17.760
Look who's here.

10:18.320 --> 10:19.360
Great minds think alike.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.080
Here, Lanfang.

10:26.920 --> 10:28.320
You need to get things off

10:28.640 --> 10:29.680
your chest.

10:31.080 --> 10:32.160
Or don't talk.

10:32.800 --> 10:33.640
Just eat.

10:34.080 --> 10:34.640
Come on.

10:38.920 --> 10:39.800
I keep thinking

10:41.320 --> 10:42.400
about the cash.

10:42.400 --> 10:43.920
A few grand left in my register...

10:44.440 --> 10:44.960
It was for

10:45.000 --> 10:46.760
holiday gifts.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.520
Why didn't I grab it?

10:50.120 --> 10:52.200
How could I be so stupid?

10:52.760 --> 10:54.640
No one saw this coming.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.840
Stop

10:56.280 --> 10:57.640
beating yourself up.

10:57.680 --> 10:58.840
It's all on me!

10:59.880 --> 11:01.400
All of Ye's textbooks are gone.

11:01.440 --> 11:03.080
Wu's prep materials too.

11:05.400 --> 11:06.280
If they

11:06.280 --> 11:07.200
fail their

11:07.200 --> 11:08.520
college exams...

11:08.840 --> 11:10.320
I'm the one who failed them.

11:10.400 --> 11:11.200
I ruined

11:11.200 --> 11:12.920
their entire lives!

11:14.920 --> 11:16.600
Books and materials

11:16.640 --> 11:18.200
can be replaced.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.720
As long as everyone is safe,

11:21.680 --> 11:23.160
we can rebuild from scratch.

11:24.560 --> 11:25.000
Hey,

11:25.280 --> 11:27.040
why am I so cursed?

11:27.880 --> 11:29.360
The second things look up,

11:29.360 --> 11:30.720
everything goes straight

11:30.840 --> 11:32.000
to hell.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.520
Who the hell did I piss off?!

11:33.520 --> 11:35.200
But you always bounce back!

11:35.400 --> 11:37.240
Exactly! You're still standing!

11:37.520 --> 11:38.960
How's this standing?

11:40.040 --> 11:41.560
My house is ashes...

11:43.040 --> 11:44.880
My home is your home now.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.720
As long as I have a roof,

11:48.280 --> 11:49.320
you will never

11:49.320 --> 11:50.280
freeze or starve.

11:51.520 --> 11:53.320
I swear to God.

11:54.520 --> 11:54.880
Yeah,

11:55.320 --> 11:56.600
if you need cash,

11:57.120 --> 11:58.160
just take it from me.

11:58.720 --> 11:59.520
This is what

11:59.520 --> 12:00.840
we're here for.

12:01.080 --> 12:02.280
Let us help you.

12:02.280 --> 12:02.720
Yes!

12:03.000 --> 12:04.280
Take this back!

12:04.520 --> 12:05.360
I've got it too.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.280
Look at us, twin minds again.

12:09.520 --> 12:09.960
Take it.

12:10.000 --> 12:10.600
Just take it!

12:14.280 --> 12:15.120
Come on, girl.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.440
Seriously,

12:18.800 --> 12:21.560
what did I ever do to deserve

12:22.240 --> 12:24.120
friends like you?

12:25.400 --> 12:27.080
That's what besties do.

12:28.120 --> 12:29.360
Girls help girls!

12:29.800 --> 12:31.080
Who's got dead squirrels?

12:32.720 --> 12:33.320
It's New Year's!

12:33.320 --> 12:34.440
Stop with the "dead" talk!

12:35.080 --> 12:37.560
"Girls" means women,

12:38.120 --> 12:39.720
"help girls" means

12:39.720 --> 12:41.520
support each other!

12:46.920 --> 12:47.720
Here, have a bite.

12:54.240 --> 12:55.080
Easy there, sweetie.

12:55.240 --> 12:55.960
So, whose are better?

12:56.040 --> 12:56.800
Both.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.400
There you go. We got you.

13:24.960 --> 13:25.520
[Hey Wu,]

13:25.720 --> 13:26.680
[dug out the wheelchair.]

13:27.040 --> 13:27.720
[Bringing it to Grandma]

13:27.720 --> 13:28.320
[later.]

13:34.680 --> 13:36.880
[Got the books and notes]

13:37.360 --> 13:38.520
[sorted.]

13:39.320 --> 13:40.600
[Printing double copies]

13:40.680 --> 13:41.520
[at my dad's office tomorrow.]

13:41.520 --> 13:42.080
[Thanks, man.]

13:42.600 --> 13:43.360
[Xing Wu,]

13:44.040 --> 13:44.760
[hang in there.]

13:45.960 --> 13:46.680
[For her.]

15:18.960 --> 15:21.160
[3, 2, 1...]

15:21.160 --> 15:22.600
[Cheese!]

15:51.840 --> 15:53.200
[Happy New Year!]

18:35.320 --> 18:36.200
Hey,

18:37.680 --> 18:38.560
look at me.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.280
It's going to be OK.

18:42.640 --> 18:44.160
We'll rebuild. I promise.

19:26.160 --> 19:27.040
What are you doing here?

19:30.520 --> 19:31.680
I woke up

19:32.160 --> 19:33.120
and you were gone.

19:34.080 --> 19:34.720
I figured

19:35.360 --> 19:36.640
you'd be here.

19:37.080 --> 19:37.840
And...

19:39.160 --> 19:39.960
I had to

19:40.720 --> 19:42.720
find your gift.

19:45.920 --> 19:47.200
What did you get me?

19:48.200 --> 19:49.160
A keychain.

19:49.760 --> 19:51.040
Under your pillow.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.760
I wanted it

19:54.000 --> 19:55.640
to be the first thing you saw

19:57.120 --> 19:57.920
this morning...

20:00.400 --> 20:01.000
Hey, what...

20:13.360 --> 20:14.120
Did you find it?

20:17.800 --> 20:18.520
Is this it?

20:18.880 --> 20:19.520
Yeah...

20:21.880 --> 20:23.320
But it's all charred.

20:24.040 --> 20:25.440
I should've just given it to you.

20:26.080 --> 20:26.680
No,

20:26.800 --> 20:27.400
I love it.

20:28.240 --> 20:29.400
It has that distressed look now.

20:29.840 --> 20:30.720
It's perfect.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.640
Hey, I took a look inside.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.840
A lot of stuff is still salvageable.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.080
I'm gonna call Mom

20:39.080 --> 20:39.920
and tell her.

20:41.120 --> 20:41.840
That's wonderful news!

20:42.200 --> 20:43.800
It's not over

20:44.040 --> 20:45.120
for the salon!

20:46.440 --> 20:47.520
I also sorted out the wheelchair

20:48.040 --> 20:49.200
for Grandma.

20:53.320 --> 20:54.360
You know...

20:55.360 --> 20:56.200
life has a

20:56.720 --> 20:57.760
sick sense of humor sometimes.

21:02.920 --> 21:04.440
Ever watched Forrest Gump?

21:05.880 --> 21:07.000
"Life is

21:07.960 --> 21:09.840
like a box of chocolates."

21:10.880 --> 21:11.640
"You never know

21:11.640 --> 21:12.960
what you're gonna get."

21:16.560 --> 21:19.520
Right now, it's bitter.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.000
But the next one

21:21.800 --> 21:22.840
is gonna be sweet.

21:31.560 --> 21:32.320
Can I take it?

21:37.200 --> 21:37.920
Hey,

21:38.800 --> 21:40.120
I know everything

21:41.760 --> 21:43.040
will work out for us.

21:46.720 --> 21:47.520
I know it will.

21:58.360 --> 21:59.880
We're gonna build

22:00.840 --> 22:01.520
a better house.

22:03.120 --> 22:04.440
It'll be so much

22:04.920 --> 22:05.600
cozier!

22:06.640 --> 22:07.080
Oh, definitely.

22:07.720 --> 22:08.400
Your room

22:08.400 --> 22:09.600
is getting a makeover.

22:10.120 --> 22:11.040
Where does the family photo go?

22:11.520 --> 22:12.000
In the bedrooms!

22:12.240 --> 22:13.400
Every single one.

22:13.880 --> 22:16.520
I'll build you a huge walk-in closet

22:16.520 --> 22:17.040
with a full-length

22:17.040 --> 22:18.080
mirror!

22:19.960 --> 22:21.080
And put in AC!

22:22.240 --> 22:23.400
No more used units.

22:23.400 --> 22:24.160
Brand new, baby.

22:24.920 --> 22:25.800
Grandma's room needs one too.

22:26.840 --> 22:27.320
Definitely.

22:27.800 --> 22:29.280
And all new gear

22:29.360 --> 22:30.360
for Mom's salon.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.200
Yes!

22:31.720 --> 22:33.520
More shampoo chairs

22:33.680 --> 22:34.800
will boost business!

22:34.920 --> 22:36.160
Look at us, totally in sync.

22:41.040 --> 22:41.680
But...

22:42.760 --> 22:43.960
rebuilding is gonna cost

22:45.720 --> 22:47.520
a crazy amount of money, right?

22:55.080 --> 22:55.560
Yeah.

23:02.960 --> 23:03.600
But we'll figure it out.

23:06.280 --> 23:07.240
Are you...

23:07.880 --> 23:09.720
dropping out to

23:10.040 --> 23:10.960
make money?

23:15.200 --> 23:15.920
Not

23:17.640 --> 23:18.520
this time.

23:19.520 --> 23:20.640
I'm doing

23:22.520 --> 23:23.320
both!

24:30.800 --> 24:31.320
Hey,

24:32.440 --> 24:33.560
went to the salon already?

24:37.600 --> 24:39.280
Doesn't that fire seem

24:39.280 --> 24:40.400
a bit fishy?

24:40.840 --> 24:42.320
The cops are on it.

24:42.840 --> 24:44.160
On New Year's?

24:44.160 --> 24:45.760
It's textbook arson!

24:48.000 --> 24:48.800
And

24:48.800 --> 24:49.560
Big G and I

24:49.560 --> 24:50.960
think it's revenge.

24:51.760 --> 24:52.640
Ever since

24:52.640 --> 24:53.520
those guys

24:53.520 --> 24:54.760
got busted,

24:55.040 --> 24:55.800
I knew

24:55.960 --> 24:57.080
they'd want payback.

24:57.720 --> 24:59.000
Sure, Cao Fan

24:59.000 --> 25:00.000
helped us out,

25:00.560 --> 25:02.880
but her brother

25:04.200 --> 25:05.520
is a loose cannon.

25:16.680 --> 25:17.880
Dude! What the hell?

25:20.520 --> 25:21.200
Get off me!

25:21.200 --> 25:22.200
Did you burn my house down?!

25:22.760 --> 25:23.520
What you talking about?

25:23.960 --> 25:25.160
My house burned down last night!

25:25.320 --> 25:26.200
Tell me you didn't do it!

25:26.200 --> 25:26.880
What does that

25:26.880 --> 25:28.280
have to do with me?!

25:32.280 --> 25:33.680
Then explain the gas sitting right there!

25:34.680 --> 25:36.000
It's just gas!

25:36.520 --> 25:37.280
If I did it,

25:37.280 --> 25:38.520
would I still be here?

25:38.880 --> 25:40.040
Start talking.

25:41.000 --> 25:41.840
I already called the cops.

25:44.560 --> 25:45.160
Get the hell

25:45.240 --> 25:45.880
off me!

25:51.400 --> 25:52.800
[I don't care what happens to me.]

25:54.520 --> 25:56.280
[But I'm not dragging my sister down.]

26:12.840 --> 26:13.560
Believe me or don't.

26:32.200 --> 26:32.720
Yeah?

26:33.320 --> 26:33.920
[Hey,]

26:34.400 --> 26:35.680
[Officer Xu came over.]

26:36.160 --> 26:37.400
[He wants you in the precinct.]

26:37.960 --> 26:39.520
[They're looking into the fire,]

26:39.840 --> 26:41.440
[gathering clues and evidence.]

26:42.120 --> 26:43.280
[Do you think it was Cao Ping?]

26:43.560 --> 26:44.520
I'm with him now.

26:45.680 --> 26:46.600
I think he's clean.

26:47.280 --> 26:48.640
I'm on my way now.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.880
We found

26:54.880 --> 26:55.800
the cause of the fire.

26:57.200 --> 26:57.720
Take a look.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.240
Yang Gang?

27:01.600 --> 27:02.000
Right.

27:02.400 --> 27:03.520
According to

27:03.880 --> 27:04.600
our investigation,

27:05.200 --> 27:06.600
witnesses saw him

27:06.680 --> 27:07.760
loitering near your yard.

27:31.760 --> 27:32.760
He tossed

27:32.760 --> 27:34.000
a lit cigarette,

27:34.000 --> 27:35.240
which caught the cardboard on fire.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.200
It spread

27:50.600 --> 27:51.720
and took down the building.

27:51.880 --> 27:52.800
We've officially

27:52.800 --> 27:53.720
booked him.

27:59.640 --> 28:00.400
Sir,

28:01.280 --> 28:02.720
it was an accident!

28:03.400 --> 28:03.600
Hey,

28:03.600 --> 28:04.680
accidents aren't crimes, right?

28:05.080 --> 28:06.200
We know how

28:06.520 --> 28:07.600
the fire started.

28:08.520 --> 28:09.800
You flicked

28:09.800 --> 28:11.360
a cigarette butt.

28:12.080 --> 28:12.880
That's criminal negligence.

28:13.240 --> 28:15.040
You endangered

28:15.240 --> 28:15.800
public

28:15.840 --> 28:16.440
safety.

28:17.080 --> 28:18.000
For minor

28:18.520 --> 28:20.040
damage,

28:20.640 --> 28:21.360
you face

28:21.360 --> 28:22.640
up to three years.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.560
But for

28:24.080 --> 28:25.000
severe damage,

28:25.520 --> 28:26.400
it's

28:26.440 --> 28:27.240
three

28:27.280 --> 28:28.600
to seven years.

28:28.680 --> 28:30.120
It was just a cigarette!

28:30.280 --> 28:31.920
I didn't know it'd do this!

28:31.960 --> 28:33.320
You have the right to a lawyer.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.200
But we are

28:35.440 --> 28:36.360
far from done.

28:36.920 --> 28:37.920
W-what do you mean?

28:38.160 --> 28:39.880
We raided your warehouse.

28:40.120 --> 28:41.000
You're facing

28:41.040 --> 28:42.160
trafficking charges.

28:42.760 --> 28:43.440
Most of

28:43.760 --> 28:45.760
that inventory

28:46.080 --> 28:46.600
is stolen.

28:47.000 --> 28:48.120
No!

28:48.560 --> 28:49.560
They're refurbished!

28:49.720 --> 28:50.560
If you can't explain

28:50.560 --> 28:51.880
where you

28:52.120 --> 28:53.560
got those goods,

28:53.560 --> 28:54.200
we are

28:54.920 --> 28:55.920
going to

28:56.400 --> 28:58.120
prosecute.

28:58.600 --> 29:00.600
So you'd better

29:00.600 --> 29:01.280
start

29:01.720 --> 29:03.520
cooperating.

29:06.080 --> 29:06.520
Easy.

29:06.800 --> 29:07.560
Thank you.

29:07.680 --> 29:08.200
No problem.

29:08.960 --> 29:09.760
So,

29:09.800 --> 29:10.880
that's where we stand.

29:11.000 --> 29:11.800
You guys head on home.

29:12.120 --> 29:13.000
I'll call

29:13.160 --> 29:14.040
if anything comes up.

29:15.280 --> 29:15.800
Wu,

29:16.160 --> 29:17.000
take care of Grandma.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.560
Thank you, Officer Xu.

29:18.760 --> 29:19.040
Any time.

29:19.040 --> 29:19.560
Thanks for everything.

29:19.680 --> 29:20.120
Have a good one.

29:20.200 --> 29:20.520
Thanks

29:20.520 --> 29:21.120
- again.
- Later!

29:23.960 --> 29:25.240
Like he mentioned,

29:25.560 --> 29:26.960
Yang Gang has zero assets.

29:27.520 --> 29:28.200
We're not

29:28.200 --> 29:29.240
getting any compensation.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.360
So it's up to us.

29:33.720 --> 29:36.280
We finally paid off the debt,

29:36.960 --> 29:37.640
and now

29:38.240 --> 29:39.640
we're back to square one.

29:40.040 --> 29:40.920
It's fine, Mom.

29:41.560 --> 29:43.720
Think of it as starting

29:44.120 --> 29:45.080
a new chapter.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.760
I hate putting you through this!

29:49.760 --> 29:50.400
I'm OK.

29:50.400 --> 29:50.960
Grandma,

29:51.400 --> 29:52.360
every cloud has a silver lining.

29:52.800 --> 29:53.640
We will

29:53.800 --> 29:55.560
get through this!

29:56.440 --> 29:56.920
Grandma,

29:57.440 --> 29:58.440
I'll do whatever it takes.

29:58.880 --> 29:59.880
We're gonna be OK.

30:00.520 --> 30:00.960
Relax!

30:02.800 --> 30:03.680
It's New Year's.

30:04.200 --> 30:05.920
We're together, and we're alive.

30:06.000 --> 30:07.360
That's the best gift!

30:07.720 --> 30:08.880
So let me see some smiles!

30:09.200 --> 30:09.720
Smile for me!

30:10.520 --> 30:10.960
And you!

30:12.160 --> 30:12.640
Come on!

30:13.560 --> 30:14.400
Let's go home!

30:23.360 --> 30:24.640
Hey, listen to that.

30:24.640 --> 30:25.800
Some kinda festival?

30:26.040 --> 30:27.320
Praying to the sea gods,

30:27.320 --> 30:28.120
probably.

30:28.400 --> 30:30.080
We should definitely join in.

30:47.080 --> 30:48.080
Coastal folks like us

30:48.160 --> 30:49.520
always pray to the sea gods.

30:49.960 --> 30:51.240
May the gods

30:51.240 --> 30:52.920
watch over us

30:53.240 --> 30:54.880
and keep

30:55.160 --> 30:56.440
our family

30:56.520 --> 30:57.960
safe.

30:59.920 --> 31:01.640
Please let Wu

31:01.880 --> 31:03.000
and Ye

31:03.200 --> 31:04.400
get into

31:04.440 --> 31:05.680
their dream colleges.

31:08.080 --> 31:09.680
Keep Grandma healthy,

31:10.760 --> 31:11.800
get princess into

31:11.800 --> 31:13.040
her dream school...

31:13.400 --> 31:14.240
and make Mom...

31:15.160 --> 31:15.800
filthy rich!

31:20.000 --> 31:20.720
[I wish]

31:21.240 --> 31:22.680
[we could be a family forever.]

31:23.800 --> 31:26.320
[And that he and I never part.]

31:29.520 --> 31:30.080
What did you

31:30.400 --> 31:31.040
wish for?

31:32.080 --> 31:32.760
Secret.

31:33.440 --> 31:34.360
You gotta say it out loud

31:34.520 --> 31:35.400
for it to work.

31:35.640 --> 31:36.560
Liar.

31:37.040 --> 31:38.200
It'll work either way.

31:52.680 --> 31:54.200
[Hawthorns are incredibly sour.]

31:55.080 --> 31:56.520
[But coat them in hard sugar,]

31:57.200 --> 31:58.520
[and they're the sweetest holiday treat.]

32:00.040 --> 32:01.480
[Life is pretty much the same.]

32:02.240 --> 32:04.440
[Coating the sour days in sugar]

32:05.520 --> 32:06.640
[is what makes them sweet to remember.]

32:13.280 --> 32:14.040
Alright, I'm off!

32:14.600 --> 32:15.920
Thanks for letting us stay.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.680
Don't be silly. It's nothing.

32:18.120 --> 32:18.680
Thank you.

32:19.080 --> 32:20.360
We won't stay long.

32:20.840 --> 32:21.280
Yeah,

32:21.320 --> 32:23.640
we'll look for a place

32:23.960 --> 32:24.680
after the holidays.

32:25.120 --> 32:26.160
No way.

32:26.160 --> 32:28.120
My home is your home.

32:28.520 --> 32:29.920
Stay as long

32:30.320 --> 32:31.520
as you need.

32:31.600 --> 32:32.200
You are the best.

32:33.520 --> 32:33.920
Oh,

32:35.040 --> 32:36.400
here are the keys.

32:36.400 --> 32:36.760
Got'em.

32:36.920 --> 32:37.960
I'll make copies if you need.

32:38.200 --> 32:39.440
No, this is perfect.

32:40.520 --> 32:41.120
Bye,

32:41.360 --> 32:41.880
guys!

32:42.080 --> 32:42.600
Text me.

32:42.680 --> 32:43.560
Bye, Shanxi.

32:43.600 --> 32:44.280
Safe travels.

32:45.600 --> 32:46.200
Hey, Wu.

32:46.520 --> 32:47.160
Thanks for everything.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.200
Don't mention it.

32:48.560 --> 32:48.880
Sorry for the trouble.

32:48.880 --> 32:49.600
Call me if you need anything.

32:49.680 --> 32:50.000
Peace!

32:50.400 --> 32:51.080
Mom and I

32:51.160 --> 32:52.400
will take Shanxi's room.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.920
Ye can have Big G's room.

32:56.040 --> 32:57.040
And him?

32:57.640 --> 32:58.360
I'll crash on the couch.

33:00.520 --> 33:01.160
What's all this?

33:02.080 --> 33:03.200
Neighbors put some stuff together.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.040
Clothes and toiletries.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.560
Just to get us by for now.

33:05.680 --> 33:06.520
Prices are crazy

33:06.920 --> 33:07.640
during the holidays.

33:07.720 --> 33:08.120
OK.

33:08.520 --> 33:09.040
I'll bring them in.

33:09.080 --> 33:09.520
Sure.

33:10.120 --> 33:10.760
Lanfang,

33:11.040 --> 33:12.600
I gave you my savings.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.400
Why aren't we using them?

33:15.640 --> 33:16.880
Mom, rule number one:

33:16.880 --> 33:17.960
never dip into

33:18.000 --> 33:19.360
your nest egg.

33:19.560 --> 33:20.640
We're keeping that

33:20.640 --> 33:21.440
safe for you.

33:22.160 --> 33:24.040
We're in a crisis here!

33:24.400 --> 33:26.840
It's a rainy day,

33:26.920 --> 33:28.520
use the fund!

33:28.640 --> 33:29.240
Alright, alright,

33:29.520 --> 33:30.360
we'll use it.

33:30.640 --> 33:32.000
But I'm paying you back

33:32.080 --> 33:32.960
with interest

33:32.960 --> 33:34.200
once my business is up again.

33:35.800 --> 33:36.320
Princess,

33:37.200 --> 33:37.880
take it.

33:38.000 --> 33:38.760
Go

33:38.760 --> 33:39.640
cash it out

33:39.640 --> 33:40.520
with Wu.

33:42.320 --> 33:42.880
Grandma,

33:43.080 --> 33:43.880
Auntie's gonna

33:44.200 --> 33:45.600
triple your investment!

33:45.960 --> 33:46.440
Good!

33:46.880 --> 33:48.360
I'm holding her to that!

33:50.320 --> 33:51.240
Wait, are you sure

33:51.240 --> 33:52.280
there's only 300?

33:52.560 --> 33:53.120
Yes, sir.

33:54.040 --> 33:54.880
But she told us

33:54.880 --> 33:56.080
there was ten grand.

33:56.320 --> 33:56.720
Yeah.

33:56.920 --> 33:57.800
One second.

33:57.800 --> 33:58.960
Let me print out your statement.

34:00.640 --> 34:01.680
Here you go.

34:05.560 --> 34:06.520
356...

34:07.720 --> 34:08.159
Maybe

34:08.840 --> 34:10.280
Grandma got confused.

34:11.159 --> 34:12.199
Can you pull up

34:12.199 --> 34:13.080
the transaction history, please?

34:13.199 --> 34:13.920
Sure, one moment.

34:18.000 --> 34:19.239
There was

34:19.239 --> 34:20.120
over ten grand before,

34:20.120 --> 34:21.719
but it was withdrawn two years ago.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.400
Thanks.

34:31.120 --> 34:31.679
Wu...

34:32.000 --> 34:32.840
You know who did it,

34:32.880 --> 34:33.760
don't you?

34:34.520 --> 34:35.040
My deadbeat father.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.440
Your dad?

34:38.520 --> 34:39.920
That explains why he

34:39.960 --> 34:40.760
took her ID

34:41.159 --> 34:41.920
and made her sign

34:41.920 --> 34:42.840
that consent form.

34:43.239 --> 34:44.199
To cover

34:44.199 --> 34:45.040
his

34:45.520 --> 34:47.080
gambling debts?

34:47.520 --> 34:48.960
He's buried in debt and still

34:49.080 --> 34:50.400
has the balls to rob her.

34:51.239 --> 34:52.199
Where is he now?

34:53.840 --> 34:54.520
He's dead to me!

35:11.560 --> 35:12.600
Lanfang!

35:13.400 --> 35:15.200
Found some shears!

35:15.200 --> 35:15.920
Are they still good?

35:16.120 --> 35:17.120
Keep them!

35:17.280 --> 35:18.000
Got it.

35:20.440 --> 35:20.960
Lanfang!

35:22.640 --> 35:23.320
- Liu Nian?
- Lanfang...

35:23.640 --> 35:24.080
What are you...

35:24.280 --> 35:25.160
I hopped on the first bus

35:25.320 --> 35:26.360
when I heard it.

35:27.120 --> 35:29.120
This is awful...

35:32.520 --> 35:34.640
I wanted us to go big,

35:35.080 --> 35:36.120
and now

35:36.240 --> 35:37.560
I've put you

35:37.880 --> 35:38.920
out of a job.

35:39.200 --> 35:39.960
It's fine.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.320
If you'll still have me,

35:41.440 --> 35:42.120
I'm sticking with you.

35:42.400 --> 35:42.800
See,

35:43.400 --> 35:44.400
brought all my stuff!

35:45.160 --> 35:46.880
What's the point?

35:46.920 --> 35:48.160
Go get

35:48.160 --> 35:49.760
a real job.

35:50.080 --> 35:51.320
Or what?

35:51.320 --> 35:52.320
You and

35:52.320 --> 35:53.520
your grandma are gonna starve?

35:54.600 --> 35:55.120
Hey,

35:55.120 --> 35:56.600
you've hit rock bottom.

35:56.760 --> 35:57.760
I have to be here.

35:57.760 --> 35:59.120
I couldn't live with myself otherwise!

35:59.240 --> 36:00.000
If you stay,

36:00.000 --> 36:01.360
I'll feel like sh*t.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.520
I ain't got no dime to...

36:04.760 --> 36:05.840
Look,

36:06.080 --> 36:07.520
find a steady job

36:07.560 --> 36:09.440
with a real paycheck.

36:13.160 --> 36:13.640
Fine,

36:13.960 --> 36:15.000
you win.

36:15.280 --> 36:17.560
But I'm a phone call away,

36:17.720 --> 36:18.520
OK?

36:19.080 --> 36:19.840
Let me at least

36:19.960 --> 36:20.880
help you clean up.

36:21.760 --> 36:22.360
Liu Nian...

36:50.280 --> 36:50.960
- Auntie...
- Mom...

36:51.800 --> 36:52.400
Hey!

36:53.000 --> 36:53.520
Did we

36:54.000 --> 36:54.720
get the money?

36:57.640 --> 36:58.160
What's with the faces?

36:58.680 --> 36:59.880
Grandma's account is wiped out.

37:01.320 --> 37:02.000
Wiped out?

37:02.600 --> 37:03.840
Yeah. Years ago.

37:04.880 --> 37:05.920
That f*cker took every cent.

37:08.720 --> 37:09.960
How do you know?

37:10.360 --> 37:11.720
The bank records.

37:12.160 --> 37:13.920
The paper trail doesn't lie.

37:15.560 --> 37:16.240
Nobody else

37:16.800 --> 37:17.880
would pull that sh*t.

37:25.800 --> 37:27.440
Keep this from Grandma.

37:28.760 --> 37:30.040
Stuff some paper

37:30.080 --> 37:31.040
in an envelope,

37:31.920 --> 37:33.320
and tell her we got the cash.

37:37.760 --> 37:38.440
Let's clean up.

37:38.800 --> 37:39.320
We'll be OK.

37:54.680 --> 37:56.600
What a feast!

37:57.360 --> 37:57.920
See?

37:58.240 --> 37:59.720
This is why we have savings.

38:04.080 --> 38:04.920
Grandma's right.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.120
We got

38:07.120 --> 38:08.560
plenty of cash now.

38:08.840 --> 38:09.880
We're totally set.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.160
Yeah, Mom.

38:11.520 --> 38:12.640
They already gave me

38:12.640 --> 38:13.360
the money.

38:13.520 --> 38:14.800
Rest easy.

38:15.840 --> 38:17.080
You kids work so hard.

38:17.080 --> 38:18.640
You need to

38:18.880 --> 38:20.120
keep your energy up.

38:20.680 --> 38:21.080
Eat up!

38:21.400 --> 38:21.920
Come on.

38:21.920 --> 38:23.360
Mom, let me get you more soup.

38:23.440 --> 38:23.680
Alright.

38:23.720 --> 38:24.880
This fish is unreal.

38:25.720 --> 38:26.240
Oh, yeah,

38:28.680 --> 38:29.920
tastes like the good stuff.

38:30.000 --> 38:30.520
Yeah.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.760
Pairs perfectly with tofu.

38:33.240 --> 38:34.080
So healthy.

38:34.120 --> 38:34.520
Here.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.000
Thanks, sweetie.

40:37.240 --> 40:38.920
Please, just hear me out!

40:38.920 --> 40:40.040
I wasn't trying to

40:40.040 --> 40:41.040
hide it.

40:41.520 --> 40:42.120
It's not

40:42.120 --> 40:43.240
what you think.

40:43.520 --> 40:43.960
Please,

40:44.320 --> 40:45.120
just hear me out!

40:45.400 --> 40:46.360
Save it!

40:46.760 --> 40:47.320
You lied about

40:47.320 --> 40:48.000
your record!

40:48.400 --> 40:49.440
I didn't lie.

40:49.800 --> 40:50.800
They never

40:50.800 --> 40:51.760
asked.

40:51.840 --> 40:52.720
I don't care.

40:53.040 --> 40:54.160
No ex-cons here!

40:54.520 --> 40:55.040
You need to leave!

40:55.320 --> 40:55.800
Wait!

40:56.520 --> 40:56.880
What

40:57.280 --> 40:58.840
about my pay?

40:59.360 --> 41:00.000
Don't worry,

41:00.200 --> 41:01.240
I'll pay you.

41:01.760 --> 41:02.640
I'm sending the money now.

41:03.760 --> 41:04.960
I've been working

41:04.960 --> 41:05.880
since dawn.

41:06.560 --> 41:07.440
Can I

41:07.520 --> 41:09.400
at least get a meal?

41:10.200 --> 41:10.880
Eat and beat it!

41:37.640 --> 41:38.320
Here's some water.

41:56.240 --> 41:56.920
Wanna

41:57.560 --> 41:58.400
talk about it?

42:01.280 --> 42:02.320
Nothing to say.

42:03.240 --> 42:04.040
Got sacked.

42:04.880 --> 42:05.560
No one wants

42:05.560 --> 42:06.440
an ex-con.

42:16.520 --> 42:17.080
What's this?

42:17.880 --> 42:18.400
A job.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.520
I ain't know sh*t

42:26.040 --> 42:26.800
about seafood.

42:27.280 --> 42:28.240
Who'd hire a guy

42:28.880 --> 42:29.520
like me anyway?

42:32.560 --> 42:33.200
Don't worry.

42:34.160 --> 42:35.000
It's a fishery run by

42:35.000 --> 42:35.600
Fan's friend.

42:37.160 --> 42:37.840
I already vouched

42:37.840 --> 42:38.640
for you.

42:41.280 --> 42:42.240
Your call.

42:42.360 --> 42:42.880
I'll leave it here.

43:14.800 --> 43:15.600
Hi, Mr. Sun.

43:15.800 --> 43:16.600
Happy New Year!

43:17.040 --> 43:17.560
[Hey,]

43:18.000 --> 43:18.760
[Happy New Year, kiddo!]

43:19.680 --> 43:20.280
I was hoping...

43:20.280 --> 43:20.920
[One sec...]

43:22.280 --> 43:22.760
Sure.

43:23.280 --> 43:24.320
[Now serving 101]

43:24.320 --> 43:25.400
[at Window 3.]

43:25.720 --> 43:26.440
[That's me.]

43:26.520 --> 43:27.160
[Thank you!]

43:27.520 --> 43:28.360
[Sweetheart, go ahead.]

43:29.680 --> 43:30.960
Wait, are you in a hospital?

43:31.200 --> 43:32.440
Is everything OK?

43:33.200 --> 43:33.800
[Oh, I'm fine.]

43:34.520 --> 43:36.240
[Just picking up meds for my mother-in-law.]

43:36.560 --> 43:37.280
[She had surgery.]
